---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions | Benedictus Abigail Triwiyatno"
  description="Terms and Conditions for accessing the web development portfolio of Benedictus Abigail Triwiyatno."
>
  <main id="main-content" class="min-h-screen bg-bg py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-mono text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors mb-8 group"
        >
          <span class="transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-1">←</span>
          <span>Back to Home</span>
        </a>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink mb-4">
          Terms & Conditions
        </h1>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-subtle">
          Last updated: January 11, 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-ink-muted text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        <section class="rounded-[28px] border border-line bg-white/60 p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-2xs">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-3 font-display">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p>
            By accessing and navigating this portfolio website, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to be bound by these Terms and Conditions.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-[28px] border border-line bg-white/60 p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-2xs">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-3 font-display">2. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p>
            The content, design system, layout, code examples, project presentations, and text published on this website are the intellectual property of Benedictus Abigail Triwiyatno, unless otherwise indicated.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4">
            You may browse this website for informational purposes. Reproduction, distribution, or re-publishing of portfolio assets for commercial purposes without prior permission is prohibited.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-[28px] border border-line bg-white/60 p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-2xs">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-3 font-display">3. Project References & External Links</h2>
          <p>
            This website contains links to external platforms such as GitHub, LinkedIn, and live project demonstrations. I am not responsible for the availability, maintenance, or privacy policies of third-party external services.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-[28px] border border-line bg-white/60 p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-2xs">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-3 font-display">4. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
          <p>
            The materials and code demonstrations on this website are provided on an as-is basis. While I strive to keep all portfolio information accurate and up to date, no warranties of any kind are implied.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-[28px] border border-line bg-white/60 p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-2xs">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-3 font-display">5. Applicable Jurisdiction</h2>
          <p>
            These Terms and Conditions are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of Indonesia.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-line/60 flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-xs text-ink-subtle">
        <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Benedictus Abigail Triwiyatno</span>
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-ink transition-colors underline underline-offset-4">
          Return to Homepage
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
